Everything after that derives its applications in detail -- non-CSS surgery, Layer codes and weight reduction in Sections~\ref{sec:surgery}, \ref{sec:layer} and \ref{sec:weight}, with fault tolerance and low-level implementation in the appendices.
These are largely independent of one another and may be read in any order.
The reader should not be deterred by the length of this paper.
