\]
Choosing \(c_0\) sufficiently small makes this error at most
\(2\eps/3\).  The compiled queries contribute
\(O(\rho_hS_h)\) \(T\) gates, while their \(O(S_h)\) clean workspace
is reused throughout the sequence.

By Lemma~\ref{lem:signal-phase}, the \(O(\rho_h)\) signal phases can
