By the triangle inequality, the resulting circuit implements
\(\mathcal V\) with error at most \(\eps\).

Finally, Eq.~\eqref{eq:mux-unflatten} adds the two exact sign
diagonals outside the QSVT sequence.  Their total cost is
\(O(\sqrt K)\) \(T\) gates and clean ancillas.  Together with the
\(O(\log K)\) clean block-label and flag qubits, this gives the stated
\(T\)-count and clean-ancilla bounds.
\end{proof}

